    different events from the year.
  eventInfo: This room is the starting point of the experience. Each door or area
    leads to a different 2026 event scene.
  instructions: Look around the room, move with the controller, and choose an event
    to enter.
  nextStep: Start with one of the event rooms, then come back here when you want
    to explore another one.
